{"id": "9th-u9-q006", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "conceptual", "level": "comprehension", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u9", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u9-l1", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "personality-definition", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "'ஆளுமை' (Personality) என்பது எதனை முதன்மையாகக் குறிக்கிறது என்று பாடப்பகுதி தெளிவுபடுத்துகிறது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "மனிதனின் புறத் தோற்றத்தையும் அழகையும் மட்டும்", "B": "உள்ளார்ந்த நல்லியல்புகள், நற்பண்புகள், உலகளாவிய பார்வை மற்றும் சமூகப் பொறுப்புணர்வு ஆகியவற்றின் முழுமை", "C": "செல்வச் செழிப்பையும் அதிகாரத்தையும்", "D": "பேச்சாற்றலையும் விவாதத் திறனையும் மட்டும்"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் விளக்கம்: ஆளுமை என்பது வெறும் உடல் தோற்றம் அல்லது அழகன்று; அது ஒருவரின் உள்ளார்ந்த உயர் நற்பண்புகள், விழுமியங்கள், அகமுதிர்ச்சி மற்றும் உலகளாவிய நேயப் பார்வையின் முழுமை ஆகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "According to the prose text, what does 'Personality' (Aalumaai) primarily embody?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Superficial external physical beauty exclusively", "B": "The integration of intrinsic virtues, moral values, universal worldview, and social conscientiousness", "C": "Material affluence and political hegemony", "D": "Mere oratorical ability and debating eloquence"}, "explanation": "Personality represents inner moral maturation, universal outlook, and social commitment."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 172, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 172", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["9th_tamil", "iyal_9", "aalumaai", "definition"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u9-q007", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "factual", "level": "knowledge", "difficulty": "easy", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u9", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u9-l1", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "purananuru-kanyan-poongundranar-quote", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "\"யாதும் ஊரே யாவரும் கேளிர்\" என்னும் உலகளாவிய ஆளுமைத் தத்துவத்தை இரண்டாயிரத்து ஐந்நூறு ஆண்டுகளுக்கு முன்பே முழங்கிய சங்கப் புலவர் யார்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "கபிலர்", "B": "ஔவையார்", "C": "கணியன் பூங்குன்றனார் (புறநானூறு 192)", "D": "நக்கீரர்"}, "explanation": "சங்க இலக்கியப் புறநானூற்றுப் பாடலில் (பாடல் 192) 'யாதும் ஊரே யாவரும் கேளிர்; தீதும் நன்றும் பிறர்தர வாரா' என்று உலகளாவிய சகோதரத்துவத்தை முழங்கியவர் கணியன் பூங்குன்றனார் ஆவார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Which Sangam poet proclaimed the universal cosmopolitan maxim 'Yaathum Oore Yaavarum Kaelir' (Every town is my hometown, every human is my kin)?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Kapilar", "B": "Avvaiyar", "C": "Kaniyan Poongundranar (Purananuru 192)", "D": "Nakkeerar"}, "explanation": "Kaniyan Poongundranar articulated this timeless humanitarian ethos in Purananuru verse 192."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 173, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 173", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["9th_tamil", "iyal_9", "purananuru", "kaniyan_poongundranar"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u9-q008", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "conceptual", "level": "comprehension", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u9", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u9-l1", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "yaathum-oore-meaning", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "'யாதும் ஊரே யாவரும் கேளிர்' என்ற தொடரில் 'கேளிர்' என்னும் சொல்லின் பொருள் யாது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "அரசர்", "B": "பகைவர்", "C": "அண்டை வீட்டார்", "D": "உறவினர்"}, "explanation": "'கேளிர்' என்பதன் பொருள் 'உறவினர்' (சுற்றத்தார்) ஆகும். அதாவது, எல்லா ஊர்களும் என் ஊரே; உலகிலுள்ள மக்கள் அனைவரும் என் உறவினரே என்பது இதன் உயர்ந்த பொருளாகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "In the classic verse 'Yaathum Oore Yaavarum Kaelir', what is the exact semantic meaning of the term 'Kaelir' (கேளிர்)?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Monarchs / Rulers", "B": "Adversaries / Foes", "C": "Immediate neighbors", "D": "Kinfolk / Relatives (உறவினர்)"}, "explanation": "'Kaelir' specifically means relatives or kinfolk, emphasizing universal human fraternity."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 173, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 173", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["9th_tamil", "iyal_9", "vocab", "kaelir"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u9-q009", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "factual", "level": "comprehension", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u9", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u9-l1", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "western-philosophers-stoics", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "பாடப்பகுதியில் 'ஒன்றே உலகம்' என்னும் பரந்த மனப்பான்மையை வலியுறுத்தியதாகக் குறிப்பிடப்படும் உரோமானிய மெய்யியலாளர் யார்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "செனகா (Seneca - ஸ்டோயிக் தத்துவவாதி)", "B": "அரிஸ்டாட்டில்", "C": "சாக்ரடீஸ்", "D": "ஹோமர்"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் குறிப்பு: உரோமானியத் தத்துவஞானியான 'செனகா' என்பவர் 'நான் தனியொரு நாட்டின் குடிமகன் அல்லன்; அனைத்து உலகத்திற்கும் உரிய குடிமகன்' என்று உலகளாவிய பார்வை குறித்துப் பேசியுள்ளார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Which Roman Stoic philosopher is cited in the lesson for championing the concept of cosmopolitan world citizenship ('One World')?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Seneca (செனகா - Stoic philosopher)", "B": "Aristotle", "C": "Socrates", "D": "Homer"}, "explanation": "The Roman philosopher Seneca declared that he was not a citizen of a single nation, but a citizen of the entire cosmos."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term":