{"id": "9th-u9-q013", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "factual", "level": "knowledge", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u9", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u9-l1", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "thaninayagam-university-professorships", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "தனிநாயக அடிகள் எந்தெந்தப் பல்கலைக்கழகங்களில் பேராசிரியராகவும் தமிழ்த் துறைத் தலைவராகவும் பணியாற்றித் தமிழ்ப்பணி ஆற்றினார்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "மலேசியாவின் மலாயாப் பல்கலைக்கழகம் மற்றும் யாழ்ப்பாணப் பல்கலைக்கழகம்", "B": "ஆக்ஸ்போர்டு மற்றும் கேம்பிரிட்ஜ் பல்கலைக்கழகங்கள்", "C": "ஹார்வர்டு மற்றும் கொலம்பியா பல்கலைக்கழகங்கள்", "D": "தில்லி மற்றும் அண்ணாமலைப் பல்கலைக்கழகங்கள்"}, "explanation": "தனிநாயக அடிகளார் மலேசியாவின் கோலாலம்பூரில் உள்ள மலாயாப் பல்கலைக்கழகத்திலும், பின்னர் இலங்கையின் யாழ்ப்பாணப் பல்கலைக்கழகத்திலும் பேராசிரியராகவும் துறைத்தலைவராகவும் அருந்தமிழ்ப் பணி ஆற்றினார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "At which prominent international universities did Father Thaninayagam serve with distinction as Professor and Head of Tamil Studies?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "University of Malaya (Malaysia) and University of Jaffna (Sri Lanka)", "B": "Oxford and Cambridge Universities", "C": "Harvard and Columbia Universities", "D": "Delhi and Annamalai Universities"}, "explanation": "Father Thaninayagam headed Tamil Studies at the University of Malaya and taught at the University of Jaffna."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 176, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 176", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["9th_tamil", "iyal_9", "thaninayagam", "academic_career"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u9-q014", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "factual", "level": "knowledge", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u9", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u9-l1", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "second-world-tamil-conference-chennai", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "இரண்டாவது உலகத் தமிழாராய்ச்சி மாநாடு 1968-ஆம் ஆண்டு சென்னையில் யாருடைய தலைமையில் மிக விமரிசையாக நடைபெற்றது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "காமராசர்", "B": "பேரறிஞர் அண்ணா (முதலமைச்சர் சி. என். அண்ணாதுரை)", "C": "மு. கருணாநிதி", "D": "எம். ஜி. இராமச்சந்திரன்"}, "explanation": "இரண்டாவது உலகத் தமிழாராய்ச்சி மாநாடு 1968-இல் சென்னையில் தமிழக முதலமைச்சர் பேரறிஞர் அண்ணா அவர்களின் தலைமையில் மிக எழுச்சியாகக் கொண்டாடப்பட்டது. மெரினா கடற்கரையில் தமிழறிஞர்களுக்குச் சிலைகள் நிறுவப்பட்டன."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Under whose visionary leadership was the Second World Tamil Conference majestically organized in Chennai in 1968?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Kamarajar", "B": "Perarignar Anna (Chief Minister C. N. Annadurai)", "C": "M. Karunanidhi", "D": "M. G. Ramachandran"}, "explanation": "The Second World Tamil Conference was hosted under the Chief Ministership of Perarignar Anna in Chennai in 1968."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 176, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 176", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["9th_tamil", "iyal_9", "world_tamil_conference", "chennai_anna"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u9-q015", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "factual", "level": "comprehension", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u9", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u9-l1", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "foreign-scholars-admiration", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "தமிழின் சிறப்பினை உணர்ந்து திருக்குறளை ஆங்கிலத்தில் மொழிபெயர்த்து, 'நான் ஒரு தமிழ் மாணவன்' எனத் தம் கல்லறையில் பொறிக்கச் சொன்ன மேனாட்டு அறிஞர் யார்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "கால்டுவெல்", "B": "வீரமாமுனிவர்", "C": "ஜி. யு. போப் (G. U. Pope)", "D": "சீகன் பால்கு"}, "explanation": "ஜி. யு. போப் திருக்குறள், திருவாசகம் ஆகியவற்றை ஆங்கிலத்தில் மொழிபெயர்த்ததோடு, தமிழின் பெருமையை உலகறியச் செய்து தம் கல்லறையில் 'ஒரு தமிழ் மாணவன்' (A Student of Tamil) எனப் பொறிக்கச் சொன்னார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Which Western scholar translated Thirukkural into English and famously willed that his epitaph read 'A Student of Tamil'?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Robert Caldwell", "B": "Constanzo Beschi (Veeramamunivar)", "C": "G. U. Pope (ஜி. யு. போப்)", "D": "Bartholomaeus Ziegenbalg"}, "explanation": "Rev. G. U. Pope rendered Thirukkural and Thiruvasagam into English and requested his epitaph to describe him as a student of Tamil."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "T