{"id": "9th-u9-q062", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "conceptual", "level": "comprehension", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u9", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u9-l2", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "akkarai-poem-central-theme", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "\"சைக்கிளில் தக்காளிப் பழங்கள் உருள... / யாரும் அதை எடுத்து உதவாத / அவசர உலகத்தின் மனிதநேயமின்மையை\" கல்யாண்ஜி எதன் மூலம் தோலுரிக்கிறார்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "கடுமையான வசைச்சொற்கள் மூலம்", "B": "'அக்கறை' என்னும் அமைதியான, நுட்பமான கவிதை வரிகளின் மூலம்", "C": "அரசியல் முழக்கங்கள் மூலம்", "D": "நீதிமன்ற வழக்குகள் மூலம்"}, "explanation": "சாலையில் தக்காளி உருண்டு சிதறும் எளிய காட்சியை வைத்து, பிறருக்கு உதவ நேரமில்லாத அவசர உலகத்தின் மனிதநேயப் பற்றாக்குறையையும் அக்கறையின்மையையும் 'அக்கறை' கவிதை மூலம் மென்மையாகச் சாடுகிறார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Through what medium does Kalyanji highlight the lack of empathy in today's rushed society where rolled tomatoes from a cycle fall neglected on the street?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Through harsh polemical vitriol", "B": "Through his subtly sensitive modern poem 'Akkarai'", "C": "Through political agitational slogans", "D": "Through legal litigation"}, "explanation": "'Akkarai' portrays the neglect of fallen tomatoes as a poignant symbol of humanity's missing compassion."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 178, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 178", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["9th_tamil", "iyal_9", "akkarai", "poem_theme"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u9-q063", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "factual", "level": "knowledge", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u9", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u9-l2", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "vannadasan-short-story-collections", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "வண்ணதாசன் எழுதிய சிறுகதைத் தொகுப்புகளுள் பொருந்தாத ஒன்றைத் தேர்ந்தெடுக்கவும்:", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "கலைக்க முடியாத ஒப்பனைகள்", "B": "தோட்டத்துக்கு வெளியிலும் சில பூக்கள்", "C": "காற்று வாங்கப் போனேன் (பொருந்தாதது)", "D": "பெயர் தெரியாமல் ஒரு பறவை"}, "explanation": "கலைக்க முடியாத ஒப்பனைகள், தோட்டத்துக்கு வெளியிலும் சில பூக்கள், சமவெளி, பெயர் தெரியாமல் ஒரு பறவை, ஒரு சிறு இசை ஆகியவை வண்ணதாசனின் சிறுகதைத் தொகுப்புகள் ஆகும். 'காற்று வாங்கப் போனேன்' பொருந்தாதது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Identify the short story collection that was NOT authored by fiction master Vannadasan:", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Kalaikka Mudiyaatha Oppanaigal", "B": "Thottathukku Veliyilum Sila Pookkal", "C": "Kaatru Vaanga Ponaen (Does not belong)", "D": "Peyar Theriyaamal Oru Paravai"}, "explanation": "'Kaatru Vaanga Ponaen' is not Vannadasan's work; the others are his acclaimed story anthologies."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 179, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 179", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["9th_tamil", "iyal_9", "vannadasan", "works"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u9-q064", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "factual", "level": "knowledge", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u9", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u9-l2", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "kalyanji-father-thi-ka-si", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "கல்யாண்ஜியின் தந்தையாரான புகழ்பெற்ற தமிழ்த் திறனாய்வாளர் யார்? (இவரும் சாகித்திய அகாதெமி விருது பெற்றவர்)", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "வல்லிக்கண்ணன்", "B": "தி. சோ. வேணுகோபாலன்", "C": "க.நா. சுப்பிரமணியம்", "D": "தி. க. சிவசங்கரன் (தி.க.சி.)"}, "explanation": "கல்யாண்ஜியின் தந்தையார் மூத்த முற்போக்கு இலக்கியத் திறனாய்வாளரான தி. க. சிவசங்கரன் (தி.க.சி.) ஆவார். இவரும் சாகித்திய அகாதெமி விருது பெற்ற பெருமைக்குரியவர்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Who was Kalyanji's father, an eminent Tamil progressive literary critic who was also a Sahitya Akademi laureate?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Vallikkannan", "B": "Ti. So. Venugopalan", "C": "Ka. Naa. Subramanyam", "D": "Thi. Ka. Sivasankaran (Thi.Ka.Si. - தி.க.சி.)"}, "explanation": "His father was veteran critic Thi. Ka. Sivasankaran (Thi.Ka.Si)."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 179, "chapter":