{"id": "9th-u9-q065", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "factual", "level": "knowledge", "difficulty": "easy", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u9", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u9-l3", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "kurunthogai-opening-lines", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "\"நசை பெரிது உடையர் நல்கலும் நல்குவர் / பிடிபசி களைஇய பெருங்கை வேழம்...\" - இப்பாடல் இடம்பெற்றுள்ள சங்க நூல் எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "குறுந்தொகை (பாடல் 37)", "B": "நற்றிணை", "C": "அகநானூறு", "D": "ஐங்குறுநூறு"}, "explanation": "இப்பாடல் எட்டுத்தொகை நூல்களுள் ஒன்றான குறுந்தொகையில் 37-வது பாடலாக இடம்பெற்றுள்ளது. பாலை பாடிய பெருங்கடுங்கோ இயற்றியது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Which Sangam classical anthology contains the famous verse starting 'Nasai perithu udaiyar nalkalum nalkuvar / pidipasi kalaiya perungkai vezham...'?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Kurunthogai (Song 37 - குறுந்தொகை)", "B": "Natrinai", "C": "Akananuru", "D": "Ainkurunuru"}, "explanation": "This verse is verse 37 of Kurunthogai, composed by Paalai Paadiya Perungadungko."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 180, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 180", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["9th_tamil", "iyal_9", "kurunthogai", "verse_source"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u9-q066", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "conceptual", "level": "comprehension", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u9", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u9-l3", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "kurunthogai-nature-imagery", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "குறுந்தொகைப் பாடலில் ஆண் யானை (வேழம்) தன் பெண் யானையின் (பிடி) பசியைப் போக்க என்ன செய்ததாகக் காட்சிப்படுத்தப்பட்டுள்ளது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "குளத்துத் தாமரைத் தண்டுகளைப் பறித்துக் கொடுத்தது", "B": "யா மரத்தின் மெல்லிய கிளையை முறித்து, அதன் பட்டையை உரித்துத் தந்தது", "C": "கரும்புத் தோட்டத்தை அழித்து உணவு தேடியது", "D": "காட்டுப் பழங்களைப் பறித்துக் கொடுத்தது"}, "explanation": "பாடலின் பொருள்: ஆண் யானை தன் பெண் யானையின் பசியைப் போக்குவதற்காக யா மரத்தின் நாரை/பட்டையை உரித்து அன்போடு அளிக்கும் காட்சியைத் தலைவன் செல்லும் பாலை வழியில் காண்கிறான்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "In the Kurunthogai poem, what does the male elephant (Vezham) tenderly do to appease the hunger of the female elephant (Pidi)?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Uproots water lilies from a lake", "B": "Peels the fibrous bark of the Yaa tree's tender branch to feed her", "C": "Raids a sugarcane farm", "D": "Gathers wild forest berries"}, "explanation": "The male elephant peels the bark of the Yaa tree branch to assuage the hunger of his mate."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 180, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 180", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["9th_tamil", "iyal_9", "kurunthogai", "nature_imagery"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u9-q067", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "matching", "level": "knowledge", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u9", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u9-l3", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "kurunthogai-vocab-matching", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "குறுந்தொகைச் சொற்களையும் அவற்றுக்குரிய பொருள்களையும் பொருத்துக:\n1. நசை - அ. பெண் யானை\n2. பிடி - ஆ. விருப்பம்\n3. வேழம் - இ. உரிக்கும்\n4. பொளிக்கும் - ஈ. ஆண் யானை", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "1-அ, 2-ஆ, 3-இ, 4-ஈ", "B": "1-ஆ, 2-இ, 3-ஈ, 4-அ", "C": "1-ஆ, 2-அ, 3-ஈ, 4-இ", "D": "1-ஈ, 2-அ, 3-ஆ, 4-இ"}, "explanation": "சரியான பொருத்தம்: 1. நசை - விருப்பம் (ஆ), 2. பிடி - பெண் யானை (அ), 3. வேழம் - ஆண் யானை (ஈ), 4. பொளிக்கும் - உரிக்கும் (இ). எனவே 1-ஆ, 2-அ, 3-ஈ, 4-இ."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Match the Kurunthogai vocabulary items with their correct meanings:\n1. Nasai - a. Female elephant (பிடி)\n2. Pidi - b. Desire / Longing (விருப்பம்)\n3. Vezham - c. Peels / Strips (உரிக்கும்)\n4. Polikkum - d. Male elephant (ஆண் யானை)", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "1-a, 2-b, 3-c, 4-d", "B": "1-b, 2-c, 3-d, 4-a", "C": "1-b, 2-a, 3-d, 4-c (1-ஆ, 2-அ, 3-ஈ, 4-இ)", "D": "1-d, 2-a, 3-b, 4-c"}, "explanation": "Nasai = Desire, Pidi = Female elephant, Vezham = Male elephant, Polikkum = Strips/peels."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 181, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 181", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["9th_tamil", "iyal_9", "kurunthogai", "vocab_matching"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u9-q068", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "factual", "level": "comprehension", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u9", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u9-l3", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "kurunthogai-grammar-perungkai-mensinai", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "இலக்கணக் குறிப்புத் தருக: 'பெருங்கை', 'மென்சினை'", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "உவமைத்தொகைகள்", "B": "வினைத்தொகைகள்", "C": "வேற்றுமைத்தொகைகள்", "D": "பண்புத்தொகைகள் (பெருமை+கை, மென்மை+சினை)"}, "explanation": "பெருங்கை = பெருமை + கை (மை விகுதி); மென்சினை = மென்மை + சினை (மை விகுதி). பண்பு உருபுகள் மறைந்து வந்துள்ளதால் இவை 'பண்புத்தொகைகள்' ஆகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Provide the grammatical classification for the terms 'Perungkai' and 'Mensinai':", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Uvamaithogai", "B": "Vinaithogai", "C": "Vaetrumaithogai", "D": "Panputhogai (பண்புத்தொகைகள் - Adjectival compounds denoting quality)"}, "explanation": "Perumai + Kai and Menmai + Sinai drop the 'mai' suffix, categorizing them as Panputhogai."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 181, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 181", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["9th_tamil", "iyal_9", "kurunthogai", "grammar"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u9-q069", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "factual", "level": "comprehension", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u9", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u9-l3", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "kurunthogai-grammar-anbina", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "\"அன்பின தோழி அவர்சென்ற ஆறே\" - இதில் 'அன்பின' என்பதன் இலக்கணக் குறிப்பு யாது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "பலவின்பால் படர்க்கை வினைமுற்று (குறிப்பு வினைமுற்று)", "B": "பெயரெச்சம்", "C": "வினையெச்சம்", "D": "தொழிற்பெயர்"}, "explanation": "'ஆறு' (வழிகள்) என்பது பலவின்பால்; எனவே அவ்வழியில் உள்ள விலங்குகள் காட்டும் அன்பினைக் குறிக்கும் 'அன்பின' என்பது பலவின்பால் படர்க்கைக் குறிப்பு வினைமுற்று ஆகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "What is the grammatical classification of 'Anbina' in the line 'Anbina thozhi avar sendra aarae'?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Palavinpaal finite verb / appellative finite verb (பலவின்பால் படர்க்கை வினைமுற்று)", "B": "Relative participle (Peyarecham)", "C": "Verbal participle (Vinaiyecham)", "D": "Verbal noun (Thozhirpeyar)"}, "explanation": "'Anbina' functions as a neuter plural finite verb describing the compassionate ways of nature in the desert."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 181, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 181", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["9th_tamil", "iyal_9", "kurunthogai", "anbina_grammar"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u9-q070", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "conceptual", "level": "comprehension", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u9", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u9-l3", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "kurunthogai-thinai-thurai", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "பாடப்பகுதியில் உள்ள குறுந்தொகைப் பாடல் (பாடல் 37) எத்திணைக்குரியது? அதன் துறை யாது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "முல்லைத்திணை; தலைவன் பாசறைக்கண் தலைவியை நினைத்தது", "B": "பாலைத்திணை; தலைவன் பிரிவின்கண் ஆற்றாளாகிய தலைவியைத் தோழி ஆற்றுவித்தது", "C": "குறிஞ்சித்திணை; சிறைப்புறமாகத் தோழி செப்பியது", "D": "மருதத்திணை; பரத்தையிற் பிரிந்துவந்த தலைவனை வாயில் மறுத்தது"}, "explanation": "திணை: பாலைத்திணை (பிரிவும் பிரிவு நிமித்தமும்). துறை: பொருள் தேடப் பிரிந்து சென்ற தலைவனை நினைத்து வருந்திய தலைவியை நோக்கி, 'தலைவர் செல்லும் வழியிலும் விலங்குகள் அன்போடு வாழ்வதைக் கண்டு விரைவில் திரும்பிவிடுவார்' எனத் தோழி ஆற்றுவித்தது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "To which landscape (Thinai) does this Kurunthogai verse belong, and what is its poetic situation (Thurai)?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Mullai; hero reminiscing at the military camp", "B": "Paalai (desert); confidante consoling the grieving heroine separated from her departed hero", "C": "Kurinji; confidante speaking while hero listens behind the hedge", "D": "Marutham; refusing entry to the wandering hero"}, "explanation": "Landscape: Paalai (separation). Situation: The confidante reassures the pining heroine that nature's tender love will prompt the hero's early return."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correc