{"id": "9th-u9-q108", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "factual", "level": "comprehension", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u9", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u9-l4", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "sound-descriptions-cyclone", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "பாடநூலில் இடம்பெற்றுள்ள புயல் விவரிப்பில் 'கொளுத்துகிற சுடர்க்காற்று' என்பது எதனைக் குறிக்கிறது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "சூரியனின் வெப்பத்தை", "B": "தீப்பிடித்த கப்பலை", "C": "அடுப்பில் எரியும் தணலை", "D": "உடலைச் சுட்டெரிப்பது போன்ற வெப்பத்துடன் வீசும் சூறாவளிக் காற்று"}, "explanation": "புயல் தொடங்கும் முன் வளிமண்டல அழுத்த மாறுபாட்டால் உடலைத் தீப்போலச் சுடும் வெம்மையான சூறாவளிக் காற்று வீசியதை 'கொளுத்துகிற சுடர்க்காற்று' எனக் குறிப்பிடுகிறார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "In the textbook's description of the cyclone, what does 'Koluthugira Sudarkkaatru' depict?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Gentle thermal sunshine", "B": "A vessel burning with fire", "C": "Kitchen furnace embers", "D": "A scorching hurricane wind blowing with searing heat before the downpour"}, "explanation": "It describes the blistering hot pre-cyclonic squall."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 183, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 183", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["9th_tamil", "iyal_9", "singaram", "vocab_cyclone"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u9-q109", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "factual", "level": "knowledge", "difficulty": "easy", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u9", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u9-l4", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "singaram-simple-life", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "ப. சிங்காரம் மதுரையில் வாழ்ந்த காலத்தில் எவ்வாறு வாழ்ந்தார் எனப் பாடநூல் குறிப்பு விவரிக்கிறது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "மிக எளிய வாழ்க்கையை மேற்கொண்டு, ஆடம்பரமின்றி வாழ்ந்தார்", "B": "மிகப் பெரிய மாளிகையில் வாழ்ந்தார்", "C": "சொகுசு கார்களில் பயணம் செய்தார்", "D": "அரசியல் பதவிகளை வகித்தார்"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் குறிப்பு: ப. சிங்காரம் தாம் ஈட்டிய செல்வத்தையெல்லாம் மாணவர்க்குக் கொடுத்துவிட்டு, மதுரையில் ஒரு சிறு அறையில் எளிய மனிதராக, ஆடம்பரமற்ற தவவாழ்க்கை போன்ற எளிய வாழ்வை மேற்கொண்டார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "How did writer Pa. Singaram spend his later years in Madurai according to the biographical sketch?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Leading a strictly austere, simple, and unpretentious life (மிக எளிய வாழ்க்கை)", "B": "Residing in an opulent palatial mansion", "C": "Traveling in luxury vehicles", "D": "Holding political office"}, "explanation": "He led an ascetic, humble life in a small rented room in Madurai."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 186, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 186", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["9th_tamil", "iyal_9", "singaram", "simple_life"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u9-q110", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "factual", "level": "comprehension", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u9", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u9-l4", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "storm-passing-sky-imagery", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "புயல் கடந்த பிறகு வானில் தெரிந்த காட்சியாகப் பாடப்பகுதியில் விவரிக்கப்படுவது எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "வானம் இருண்டு மழை கொட்டியது", "B": "\"சூரியன் வெளிப்பட்டது; முகில்கள் வெண்மைகளாகச் சிதறி ஓடின; வானமும் கடலும் அமைதி பெற்றன\"", "C": "எரிகற்கள் விழுந்தன", "D": "வானவில் மட்டுமே தெரிந்தது"}, "explanation": "புயலின் கொடூரம் ஓய்ந்ததும், சூரியன் பிரகாசித்து முகில்கள் சிதறி ஓடி வானமும் கடலும் பளிங்கு போல அமைதி நிலைக்குத் திரும்பியதை ஆசிரியர் அழகுற விவரித்துள்ளார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "What sky imagery is celebrated in the text when the cyclone finally blew over?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Sky darkened with perpetual torrential rain", "B": "Sun emerged, dark clouds scattered as white wisps, and sea and sky regained peace", "C": "Meteors showering into the sea", "D": "A static rainbow alone"}, "explanation": "The sun emerged bright and clear as fractured clouds scattered across a tranquil sky."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 185, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 185", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["9th_tamil", "iyal_9", "singaram", "sky_imagery"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u9-q111", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "conceptual", "level": "comprehension", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u9", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u9-l4", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "diaspora-tamil-experience", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "'புயலிலே ஒரு தோணி' விரிவானப் பகுதி உணர்த்தும் தமிழர்களின் வரலாற்று உண்மை யாது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "தமிழர்கள் வெளிநாடுகளுக்குச் செல்லவே இல்லை", "B": "தமிழர்கள் கடற்பயணங்களில் அச்சம் கொண்டவர்கள்", "C": "வாழ்வாதாரத்திற்காகவும் வணிகத்திற்காகவும் கடல் கடந்து சென்று உலகெங்கும் துன்பங்களை வென்று வாழ்ந்த தமிழர்களின் பேராண்மை", "D": "தமிழர்கள் கப்பல் கட்டும் கலையை அறியாதவர்கள்"}, "explanation": "இக்கதை புலம்பெயர்ந்த ஈழ, தமிழகத் தமிழர்கள் தென்கிழக்காசிய நாடுகளில் உழைத்து, கடற்பயண ஆபத்துகளையும் உலகப்போர் நெருக்கடிகளையும் எதிர்கொண்டு வாழ்ந்த வீர வரலாற்றைப் பறைசாற்றுகிறது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "What historical reality regarding the global Tamil diaspora is reflected in this narrative?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Tamils never journeyed beyond their home territories", "B": "Tamils were terrified of sea voyages", "C": "The fortitude of Tamils crossing stormy oceans to build livelihoods globally, overcoming perils and wars", "D": "Tamils lacked shipbuilding expertise"}, "explanation": "It chronicles the resilience of Tamils venturing overseas amidst maritime peril and war."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 182, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 182", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["9th_tamil", "iyal_9", "singaram", "diaspora_history"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u9-q112", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "conceptual", "level": "analysis", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u9", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u9-l4", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "singaram-overall-check", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "ப. சிங்காரம் மற்றும் 'புயலிலே ஒரு தோணி' தொடர்பான பின்வரும் கூற்றுகளை ஆராய்க:\nI. ப. சிங்காரம் சிவகங்கை மாவட்டம் சிங்கம்புணரியைச் சேர்ந்தவர்.\nII. இந்தோனேசியாவின் சுமாத்ராவில் வாழ்ந்த அனுபவத்தைக் கொண்டு நாவல்களைப் படைத்தார்.\nIII. 'கடலுக்கு அப்பால்', 'புயலிலே ஒரு தோணி' ஆகிய இரண்டும் இவரது புகழ்பெற்ற நாவல்கள்.\nIV. தம் வாழ்நாள் சேமிப்பான ஏழரை இலட்ச ரூபாயை மாணவர் கல்வி அறக்கட்டளைக்கு வழங்கினார்.", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "கூற்று I, II மட்டும் சரி", "B": "கூற்று II, III மட்டும் சரி", "C": "கூற்று I, III, IV மட்டும் சரி", "D": "கூற்று I, II, III, IV ஆகிய அனைத்தும் சரியானவை"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் குறிப்பில் உள்ள அனைத்துச் செய்திகளும் (பிறப்பிடம் சிங்கம்புணரி, சுமாத்ரா அனுபவம், இரு நாவல்கள், ஏழரை இலட்ச ரூபாய் கல்வி அறக்கட்டளை) முற்றிலும் சரியானவை."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Analyze the following statements regarding Pa. Singaram and 'Puyalilae Oru Thoni':\nI. Pa. Singaram belonged to Singampunari in Sivagangai district.\nII. He authored novels based on his real-life experiences in Sumatra, Indonesia.\nIII. 'Kadalukku Appaal' and 'Puyalilae Oru Thoni' are his two acclaimed novels.\nIV. He donated his lifetime savings of 7.5 lakh rupees to a student educational trust.", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Only I and II are correct", "B": "Only II and III are correct", "C": "Only I, III, and IV are correct", "D": "Statements I, II, III, and IV are all correct (அனைத்தும் சரி)"}, "explanation": "All four biographical and literary statements are fully accurate."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 186, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 186", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["9th_tamil", "iyal_9", "singaram", "analytical_check"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}

