{"id": "9th-u9-q114", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "conceptual", "level": "comprehension", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u9", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u9-l5", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "uvamai-ani-definition", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "ஒரு செய்யுளில் உவமானமும் உவமேயமும் வந்து, அவற்றுக்கிடையே உவம உருபு வெளிப்படையாக வருவது எவ்வகை அணியாகும்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "உருவக அணி", "B": "உவமை அணி", "C": "எடுத்துக்காட்டு உவமை அணி", "D": "வேற்றுமை அணி"}, "explanation": "ஒப்பிடப்படும் பொருள் (உவமேயம்), ஒப்பாகக் கூறப்படும் பொருள் (உவமானம்), அவற்றுக்கிடையே போல, புரைய, அன்ன, அற்று போன்ற உவம உருபுகள் வெளிப்படையாக வருவது 'உவமை அணி' எனப்படும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "When the subject (Upameya) and the analogue (Upamana) appear with the comparative particle overtly expressed, what poetic figure is formed?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Metaphor (Uruvagam)", "B": "Simile (Uvamai Ani - உவமை அணி)", "C": "Exemplary Simile", "D": "Contrast / Distinction"}, "explanation": "A simile (Uvamai Ani) overtly states the comparison using explicit particles like 'pola' or 'atru'."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 188, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 188", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["9th_tamil", "iyal_9", "uvamai_ani", "definition"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u9-q115", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "conceptual", "level": "comprehension", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u9", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u9-l5", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "eduthukkaattu-uvamai-ani-def", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "உவமானம் ஒரு தொடராகவும், உவமேயம் ஒரு தொடராகவும் வந்து, உவம உருபு மறைந்து (மறைமுகமாக) வருவது எந்த அணியாகும்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "உவமை அணி", "B": "வேற்றுமை அணி", "C": "எடுத்துக்காட்டு உவமை அணி", "D": "இல் பொருள் உவமையணி"}, "explanation": "உவமானம் ஒரு வாக்கியமாகவும், உவமேயம் மற்றொரு வாக்கியமாகவும் அமைந்து, இடையில் 'போல' போன்ற உவம உருபு வெளிப்படாமல் மறைந்து நிற்குமானால் அது 'எடுத்துக்காட்டு உவமை அணி' எனப்படும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "When the analogy and the subject form two independent clauses with the comparative particle implied (hidden), what figure of speech is it?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Direct Simile", "B": "Vaetrumai Ani", "C": "Eduthukkaattu Uvamai Ani (எடுத்துக்காட்டு உவமை அணி - Exemplary Simile)", "D": "Ilporul Uvamai Ani"}, "explanation": "Eduthukkaattu Uvamai Ani occurs when the simile's connective particle is omitted between two clauses."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corp