{"id": "9th-u9-q119", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "conceptual", "level": "comprehension", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u9", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u9-l5", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "sol-pinvarunilai-def", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "செய்யுளில் முன்னர் வந்த சொல்லே மீண்டும் மீண்டும் வந்து வெவ்வேறு பொருளைத் தருவது எவ்வகை அணி?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "பொருள் பின்வருநிலையணி", "B": "சொற்பொருள் பின்வருநிலையணி", "C": "சொல் பின்வருநிலையணி", "D": "வேற்றுமை அணி"}, "explanation": "செய்யுளில் முன்னர் வந்த சொல் மீண்டும் மீண்டும் வந்து வெவ்வேறு பொருள்களைத் தருமாயின், அது 'சொல் பின்வருநிலையணி' எனப்படும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "When the identical word recurs repeatedly throughout a poem but conveys completely different meanings each time, what figure is it?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Porul Pinvarunilai Ani", "B": "Sorporul Pinvarunilai Ani", "C": "Sol Pinvarunilai Ani (சொல் பின்வருநிலையணி - Verbal Reiteration with Divergent Meanings)", "D": "Vaetrumai Ani"}, "explanation": "Sol Pinvarunilai Ani involves the repetition of the exact phonetic word carrying diverse contextual definitions."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9",