{"id": "9th-u9-q128", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "application", "level": "application", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u9", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u9-l5", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "kural-thuppaarkku-sol-pinvarunilai", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "\"துப்பார்க்குத் துப்பாய துப்பாக்கித் துப்பார்க்குத் / துப்பாய தூஉம் மழை\" - இக்குறட்பாவில் அமைந்துள்ள அணி யாது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "பொருள் பின்வருநிலையணி", "B": "சொற்பொருள் பின்வருநிலையணி", "C": "உருவக அணி", "D": "சொல் பின்வருநிலையணி ('துப்பு' என்ற சொல் வெவ்வேறு பொருள்களில் வந்துள்ளது)"}, "explanation": "'துப்பு' என்ற ஒரே சொல் மீண்டும் மீண்டும் வந்து உண்பவர், உணவு, நுகர்ச்சி என வெவ்வேறு பொருள்களைத் தருவதால் இது 'சொல் பின்வருநிலையணி' ஆகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "What poetic figure governs the Kural couplet: 'Thuppaarkkuth thuppaaya thuppaakkith thuppaarkkuth / thuppaaya thooum mazhai'?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Porul Pinvarunilai Ani", "B": "Sorporul Pinvarunilai Ani", "C": "Uruvaga Ani", "D": "Sol Pinvarunilai Ani (The word 'Thuppu' recurs yielding diverse meanings)"}, "explanation": "'Thuppu' recurs with varied definitions (food, eater, beneficial sustenance), illustrating Sol Pinvarunilai Ani."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 190, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 190", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["9th_tamil", "iyal_9", "kural", "sol_pinvarunilai"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u9-q129", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "application", "level": "application", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u9", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u9-l5", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "poem-avizhnthana-porul-pinvarunilai", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "\"அவிழ்ந்தன தோன்றி அலர்ந்தன காயா / நெகிழ்ந்தன நேர்முகை முல்லை... விண்டன கொன்றை விரிந்தன செங்காந்தள்\" - இப்பாடலில் பயின்றுவந்துள்ள அணி எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "பொருள் பின்வருநிலையணி (அவிழ்ந்தன, அலர்ந்தன, நெகிழ்ந்தன, விண்டன, விரிந்தன - யாவும் 'மலர்ந்தன' என்ற ஒரே பொருள் தருபவை)", "B": "சொல் பின்வருநிலையணி", "C": "சொற்பொருள் பின்வருநிலையணி", "D": "வேற்றுமை அணி"}, "explanation": "பாடலில் அவிழ்ந்தன, அலர்ந்தன, நெகிழ்ந்தன, விண்டன, விரிந்தன என்னும் வெவ்வேறு சொற்கள் பலமுறை வந்து 'மலர்ந்தன' என்னும் ஒரே பொருளையே தருவதால் இது 'பொருள் பின்வருநிலையணி' ஆகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "In the verse 'Avizhnthana thondri alarnthana kaaya / negizhnthana naermugai mullai... vindana kondrai virinthana sengkaanthal', what figure is displayed?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Porul Pinvarunilai Ani (Varied verbs all uniquely signifying 'blossomed' - மலர்ந்தன)", "B": "Sol Pinvarunilai Ani", "C": "Sorporul Pinvarunilai Ani", "D": "Vaetrumai Ani"}, "explanation": "Different verbs (avizhnthana, alarnthana, negizhnthana, vindana, virinthana) all mean 'blossomed', making it Porul Pinvarunilai Ani."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 190, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 190", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["9th_tamil", "iyal_9", "porul_pinvarunilai", "example"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u9-q130", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "application", "level": "application", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u9", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u9-l5", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "kural-theeyinaal-sutta-vaetrumai", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "\"தீயினால் சுட்ட புண் உள்ளாறும் ஆறாதே / நாவினால் சுட்ட வடு\" - இக்குறட்பாவில் அமைந்துள்ள அணி யாது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "உவமை அணி", "B": "வேற்றுமை அணி (தீப்புண், நாப்புண் இரண்டின் சுடுந்தன்மையை ஒற்றுமைப்படுத்தி, பின் ஆறும்-ஆறாது என வேறுபடுத்தியது)", "C": "உருவக அணி", "D": "வஞ்சப்புகழ்ச்சி அணி"}, "explanation": "தீயினால் உண்டான புண்ணும், நாவினால் உண்டான புண்ணும் சுடும் தன்மை கொண்டவை என்ற ஒற்றுமையை முதலில் கூறி, பின்னர் தீப்புண் ஆறிவிடும் ஆனால் நாவினால் சுட்ட வடு என்றும் ஆறாது என வேறுபடுத்திக் காட்டியதால் இது 'வேற்றுமை அணி' ஆகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "What rhetorical figure of speech is demonstrated in the Kural: 'Theeyinaal sutta pun ullaarum aaraadhae / naavinaal sutta vadu'?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Uvamai Ani", "B": "Vaetrumai Ani (Contrast: equating burn pain, then contrasting physical healing vs perpetual emotional scar)", "C": "Uruvaga Ani", "D": "Vanjappugazhchi Ani"}, "explanation": "Fire and harsh words both scorch (similarity), but fire burns heal while verbal scars endure forever (distinction), creating Vaetrumai Ani."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 191, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 191", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["9th_tamil", "iyal_9", "kural", "vaetrumai_ani"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u9-q131", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "application", "level": "application", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u9", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u9-l5", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "kural-thevar-anaiyar-kayavar", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "\"தேவர் அனையர் கயவர் அவருந்தாம் / மேவன செய்தொழுக லான்\" - இக்குறளில் இடம்பெற்றுள்ள அணி எது? அது எவ்வகையைச் சார்ந்தது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "வேற்றுமை அணி", "B": "இரட்டுற மொழிதல் அணி", "C": "வஞ்சப்புகழ்ச்சி அணி (புகழ்வது போலப் பழித்தல்)", "D": "வஞ்சப்புகழ்ச்சி அணி (பழிப்பது போலப் புகழ்தல்)"}, "explanation": "கயவர்களைத் தேவர்களுக்கு நிகரானவர்கள் என்று தொடக்கத்தில் புகழ்வது போல் கூறி, தேவர்களைப் போலக் கயவர்களும் எக்கட்டுப்பாடும் இன்றித் தாம் விரும்பிய தீய செயல்களைச் செய்து திரிவர் எனப் பழித்ததால் இது 'புகழ்வது போலப் பழித்த' வஞ்சப்புகழ்ச்சி அணி ஆகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "What specific type of figure is deployed in the Kural: 'Thevar anaiyar kayavar avarundhaam / maevana seythozhuga laan'?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Vaetrumai Ani", "B": "Irattura Mozhithal Ani", "C": "Vanjappugazhchi Ani - Censure veiled as praise (புகழ்வது போலப் பழித்தல்)", "D": "Vanjappugazhchi Ani - Praise veiled as censure"}, "explanation": "Equating scoundrels to gods outwardly while condemning their shameless licentiousness exemplifies irony censuring under the guise of praise."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 192, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 192", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["9th_tamil", "iyal_9", "kural", "vanjappugazhchi_censure"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u9-q132", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "application", "level": "application", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u9", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u9-l5", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "poem-paari-maari-vanjappugazhchi", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "\"பாரி பாரி என்றுபல ஏத்தி / ஒருவர் புகழ்வர் செந்நாப் புலவர் / பாரி ஒருவனு மல்லன் / மாரியும் உண்டுஈண்டு உலகுபுரப் பதுவே\" - இப்பாடலில் பயின்றுவந்துள்ள அணி யாது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "உவமை அணி", "B": "வேற்றுமை அணி", "C": "சொற்பொருள் பின்வருநிலையணி", "D": "வஞ்சப்புகழ்ச்சி அணி (பழிப்பது போலப் புகழ்தல்)"}, "explanation": "புலவர்கள் பாரி ஒருவனையே புகழ்கிறார்களே, அவன் மட்டுமா கொடுக்கிறான், மழையும் தான் உலகைக் காக்கிறது என்று பாரியைக் குறை கூறுவது (பழிப்பது) போலப் பேசி, பாரி மாரியைப் (மழையைப்) போன்ற பெருங்கொடையாளன் எனப் புகழ்ந்ததால் இது 'பழிப்பது போலப் புகழும்' வஞ்சப்புகழ்ச்சி அணி ஆகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "In the classic verse praising chieftain Paari against rain ('Paari oruvanum allan / maariyum undu...'), what rhetorical figure is displayed?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Uvamai Ani", "B": "Vaetrumai Ani", "C": "Sorporul Pinvarunilai Ani", "D": "Vanjappugazhchi Ani - Praise disguised as censure (பழிப்பது போலப் புகழ்தல்)"}, "explanation": "Chiding poets for exalting only Paari when rain also gives, actually glorifies Paari as a universal benefactor on par with life-giving rain."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 192, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 192", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["9th_tamil", "iyal_9", "vanjappugazhchi", "praise_disguised"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u9-q133", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "application", "level": "application", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u9", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u9-l5", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "poem-insol-vilainilam-uruvagam", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "\"இன்சொல் விலைநிலமா ஈதலே வித்தாக / வன்சொற் களைகட்டு வாய்மை எருவட்டி...\" - இப்பாடலில் பயின்றுவந்துள்ள முதன்மையான அணி எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "உருவக அணி (இன்சொல் நிலமாகவும், ஈகை விதையாகவும், வன்சொல் களையாகவும், உண்மை எருவாகவும் உருவகிக்கப்பட்டுள்ளது)", "B": "உவமை அணி", "C": "வேற்றுமை அணி", "D": "இல் பொருள் உவமையணி"}, "explanation": "இப்பாடலில் இனிய சொல்லை நிலமாகவும், ஈகையை விதையாகவும், வன்சொல்லைக் களையாகவும், வாய்மையை எருவாகவும் வேறுபாடின்றி ஒன்றென உருவகம் செய்துள்ளதால் இது 'உருவக அணி' ஆகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "In the moral verse 'Insol vilainilamaa eethalae viththaaga / vansor kalaikattu vaaimai eruvatti', what primary figure is constructed?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Uruvaga Ani (Metaphor: pleasant speech is fertile land, charity is seed, harsh words are weeds, truth is fertilizer)", "B": "Uvamai Ani", "C": "Vaetrumai Ani", "D": "Ilporul Uvamai Ani"}, "explanation": "Ethical virtues are systematically metaphorized into elements of an agricultural field."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 189, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 189", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["9th_tamil", "iyal_9", "uruvagam", "insol_vilainilam"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u9-q134", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "conceptual", "level": "analysis", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u9", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u9-l5", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "uvamai-vs-uruvagam-difference", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "உவமைக்கும் உருவகத்திற்கும் இடையே உள்ள அமைப்பியல் வேறுபாட்டைச் சரியாகக் குறிப்பிடும் கூற்று எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "இரண்டுக்கும் எந்த வேறுபாடும் இல்லை", "B": "'தாமரை முகம்' என்பது உவமை; 'முகத்தாமரை' என்பது உருவகம் (உவமையில் உவமானம் முன்வரும், உருவகத்தில் உவமேயம் முன்வரும்)", "C": "'தாமரை முகம்' என்பது உருவகம்; 'முகத்தாமரை' என்பது உவமை", "D": "உவமையில் உருபு மறைந்து வரும், உருவகத்தில் உருபு வெளிப்பட்டு வரும்"}, "explanation": "உவமைத்தொகையில் உவமானம் முன்னும் பொருள் பின்னும் வரும் (தாமரை முகம்). உருவகத்தில் உவமிக்கப்படும் பொருள் முன்னும் உவமானம் பின்னும் வந்து இரண்டும் ஒன்றாகக் கருதப்படும் (முகத்தாமரை)."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Which statement correctly elucidates the structural distinction between Simile (Uvamai) and Metaphor (Uruvagam)?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "There is no structural distinction between them", "B": "'Thaamarai Mugam' is a Simile; 'Mugathaamarai' is a Metaphor (analogue comes first in simile, subject comes first in metaphor)", "C": "'Thaamarai Mugam' is a Metaphor; 'Mugathaamarai' is a Simile", "D": "Similes omit particles whereas metaphors state them overtly"}, "explanation": "In simile compounds, the analogue leads (Thaamarai-mugam); in metaphors, the tenor/subject leads (Muga-thaamarai)."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 189, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 189", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["9th_tamil", "iyal_9", "grammar_distinction", "uvamai_uruvagam"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u9-q135", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "factual", "level": "knowledge", "difficulty": "easy", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u9", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u9-l5", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "siledai-specialist-kalamegam", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "தமிழ்க் கவிஞர்களுள் சிலேடை பாடுவதில் (இரட்டுற மொழிதல் பாடுவதில்) தலைசிறந்த வல்லவராகப் போற்றப்படுபவர் யார்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "கம்பன்", "B": "புகழேந்திப் புலவர்", "C": "காளமேகப் புலவர்", "D": "ஒட்டக்கூத்தர்"}, "explanation": "சிலேடை பாடுவதில் வல்லவர் எனப் போற்றப்படும் புலவர் 'காளமேகப் புலவர்' ஆவார். காளமேகம் போலக் கவிதைகளைப் பொழிந்ததால் இவர் இப்பெயர் பெற்றார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Which illustrious Tamil poet is celebrated as the undisputed master of Double Entendre (Siledai / Irattura Mozhithal)?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Kambar", "B": "Pugazhendhi Pulavar", "C": "Kalamega Pulavar (காளமேகப் புலவர்)", "D": "Ottakoothar"}, "explanation": "Kalamega Pulavar is renowned throughout Tamil literature for his unmatched mastery of Siledai."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 191, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 191", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["9th_tamil", "iyal_9", "siledai", "kalamegam"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u9-q136", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "application", "level": "comprehension", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u9", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u9-l5", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "ilporul-uvamai-examples", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "\"வானில் பொன்மழை பொழிந்தது போலப் புழுதி பறந்தது; பாய்ந்து வந்த காளை கொம்பு முளைத்த குதிரை போலத் தாக்கியது\" - இவ்வடிகளில் பயின்றுவந்துள்ள அணி யாது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "உவமை அணி", "B": "உருவக அணி", "C": "வேற்றுமை அணி", "D": "இல் பொருள் உவமையணி (பொன்மழை, கொம்பு முளைத்த குதிரை உலகில் இல்லாதவை)"}, "explanation": "வானிலிருந்து தங்கம் மழையாகப் பொழிவதும், குதிரைக்குக் கொம்பு முளைப்பதும் உலகில் எங்குமே இல்லாத கற்பனைப் பொருள்கள். இவற்றை உவமையாகக் கூறியுள்ளதால் இது 'இல் பொருள் உவமையணி' ஆகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "In lines comparing dust to 'showering golden rain' or a charging bull to a 'horned horse', what figure is applied?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Direct Simile", "B": "Metaphor", "C": "Contrast", "D": "Ilporul Uvamai Ani (Golden rain and horned horses do not exist in the real world)"}, "explanation": "Golden rain and horned horses are nonexistent entities, making this Ilporul Uvamai Ani."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 189, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 189", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["9th_tamil", "iyal_9", "ilporul_uvamai", "examples"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u9-q137", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "factual", "level": "knowledge", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u9", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u9-l5", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "uvama-urubugal-list", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "பின்வருவனவற்றுள் உவம உருபுகளுள் (Comparative particles) அடங்காத சொல் எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "ஆயினும் (பொருந்தாதது - இணைப்புச் சொல்)", "B": "போல, புரைய", "C": "அன்ன, இன்ன", "D": "மான, கடுப்ப, அற்று"}, "explanation": "போல, புரைய, அன்ன, இன்ன, அற்று, மான, கடுப்ப, நேர ஆகியவை உவம உருபுகளாகத் தொல்காப்பியத்தில் கூறப்பட்டுள்ளன. 'ஆயினும்' என்பது உவம உருபு அல்ல; அது ஓர் இணைப்புச் சொல்லாகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Which of the following words does NOT belong to the classical inventory of Tamil comparative particles (Uvama Urubugal)?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Aayinum (Does not belong - conjunction meaning 'however')", "B": "Pola, Puraiya", "C": "Anna, Inna", "D": "Maana, Kaduppa, Atru"}, "explanation": "'Aayinum' is an adversative conjunction, not an Uvama Urubu."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 188, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 188", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["9th_tamil", "iyal_9", "uvama_urubugal", "grammar_check"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u9-q138", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "application", "level": "application", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u9", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u9-l5", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "kural-porulallavarai-sorporul", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "\"பொருளல் லவரைப் பொருளாகச் செய்யும் / பொருளல்ல தில்லை பொருள்\" - இக்குறட்பாவில் அமைந்துள்ள அணி யாது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "வேற்றுமை அணி", "B": "சொற்பொருள் பின்வருநிலையணி ('பொருள்' என்ற சொல் மீண்டும் மீண்டும் வந்து செல்வத்தைக் குறித்தது)", "C": "சொல் பின்வருநிலையணி", "D": "வஞ்சப்புகழ்ச்சி அணி"}, "explanation": "'பொருள்' என்னும் சொல் குறளில் பலமுறை வந்து செல்வம் மற்றும் மதிப்பு என்னும் பொருளிலேயே மீண்டும் மீண்டும் வந்துள்ளதால் இது 'சொற்பொருள் பின்வருநிலையணி' ஆகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "What poetic trope is exhibited in: 'Porulal lavarai porulaagach seyyum / porulalla thillai porul'?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Vaetrumai Ani", "B": "Sorporul Pinvarunilai Ani (The word 'Porul' recurs maintaining its core definition of wealth / value)", "C": "Sol Pinvarunilai Ani", "D": "Vanjappugazhchi Ani"}, "explanation": "'Porul' repeats across the couplet designating wealth and worth, exemplifying Sorporul Pinvarunilai Ani."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 190, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 190", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["9th_tamil", "iyal_9", "kural", "sorporul_pinvarunilai_kural"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u9-q139", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "conceptual", "level": "comprehension", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u9", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u9-l5", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "vaetrumai-ani-purpose", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "வேற்றுமை அணியில் கவிஞர் இரண்டு பொருள்களின் வேற்றுமையை எதற்காகக் குறிப்பிடுகிறார்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "பொருள்களின் அளவை அளவிட", "B": "கவிதையை நீளமாக்க", "C": "அவற்றுள் ஒன்றின் சிறப்பையோ அல்லது அதன் தீவிரத் தன்மையையோ வாசகனின் மனதில் ஆழமாகப் பதிய வைக்க", "D": "இலக்கண விதிகளை மீறுவதற்கு"}, "explanation": "வேற்றுமை அணியின் நோக்கம்: இரண்டுக்கும் உள்ள பொதுத் தன்மையைக் கூறிவிட்டு, பின்னர் ஒன்றின் தீமையையோ அல்லது மேன்மையையோ மிகுத்துக் காட்டி மனத்தில் ஆழப் பதிய வைப்பதாகும் (எ.கா: நாவினால் சுட்ட வடுவின் ஆறாத் தீவிரத் தன்மை)."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "What is the rhetorical purpose of highlighting the distinction in Vaetrumai Ani?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "To measure physical dimensional weight", "B": "To lengthen the stanza unnecessarily", "C": "To deeply imprint the singular gravity, intensity, or virtue of one entity over the other in the reader's psyche", "D": "To violate grammatical metrical rules"}, "explanation": "The contrast sharpens moral impact, highlighting the enduring damage of cruel words versus physical fire."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 191, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 191", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["9th_tamil", "iyal_9", "vaetrumai_ani", "purpose"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u9-q140", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "conceptual", "level": "analysis", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u9", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u9-l5", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "ani-ilakkanam-master-check", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "அணி இலக்கணம் தொடர்பான பின்வரும் கூற்றுகளை ஆராய்க:\nI. 'அணி' என்பதற்கு அழகு என்பது பொருள்.\nII. உருவக அணியில் உவமிக்கப்படும் பொருளும் உவமையும் ஒன்றெனக் கருதப்படும்.\nIII. செய்யுளில் வந்த சொல்லே மீண்டும் வந்து வெவ்வேறு பொருள் தருவது சொல் பின்வருநிலையணி.\nIV. புகழ்வது போலப் பழிப்பதும் பழிப்பது போலப் புகழ்வதும் வஞ்சப்புகழ்ச்சி அணி.", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "கூற்று I, II மட்டும் சரி", "B": "கூற்று II, III மட்டும் சரி", "C": "கூற்று I, III, IV மட்டும் சரி", "D": "கூற்று I, II, III, IV ஆகிய நான்கு கூற்றுகளும் சரியானவை"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் விளக்கங்களின்படி: அணி என்பதன் பொருள் அழகு; உருவகம் என்பது உவமையையும் பொருளையும் ஒன்றெனக் கூறுவது; சொல் பின்வருநிலை என்பது வந்த சொல்லே மீண்டும் வந்து வெவ்வேறு பொருள் தருவது; வஞ்சப்புகழ்ச்சி என்பது புகழ்வது போல் பழித்தலும் பழிப்பது போல் புகழ்தலும் ஆகும். அனைத்தும் சரியானவை."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Analyze the following statements on Tamil Poetic Rhetoric (Ani Ilakkanam):\nI. 'Ani' literally signifies beauty/ornamentation.\nII. Metaphor (Uruvagam) equates the subject directly with the analogue.\nIII. Sol Pinvarunilai Ani recurs the same word bearing different meanings.\nIV. Vanjappugazhchi Ani praises under guise of censure or censures under guise of praise.", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Only I and II are correct", "B": "Only II and III are correct", "C": "Only I, III, and IV are correct", "D": "Statements I, II, III, and IV are all correct (அனைத்தும் சரி)"}, "explanation": "All four statements correctly define foundational tenets of Tamil rhetoric."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 188, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 188", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["9th_tamil", "iyal_9", "ani_ilakkanam", "master_check"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}

