{"id": "9th-u9-q151", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "matching", "level": "comprehension", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u9", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u9-l6", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "kalaichol-matching-unit9", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "ஆங்கிலக் கலைச்சொற்களையும் அவற்றுக்குரிய தமிழ்ச் சொற்களையும் பொருத்துக:\n1. Humanism - அ. ஆளுமை\n2. Personality - ஆ. விழுமியங்கள்\n3. Values - இ. மனிதநேயம்\n4. Simile - ஈ. உவமையணி", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "1-அ, 2-ஆ, 3-இ, 4-ஈ", "B": "1-ஆ, 2-அ, 3-ஈ, 4-இ", "C": "1-இ, 2-அ, 3-ஆ, 4-ஈ", "D": "1-ஈ, 2-இ, 3-அ, 4-ஆ"}, "explanation": "சரியான பொருத்தம்: 1. Humanism - மனிதநேயம் (இ), 2. Personality - ஆளுமை (அ), 3. Values - விழுமியங்கள் (ஆ), 4. Simile - உவமையணி (ஈ). எனவே 1-இ, 2-அ, 3-ஆ, 4-ஈ."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Match the English terms with their standard Tamil counterparts:\n1. Humanism - a. Personality (ஆளுமை)\n2. Personality - b. Values (விழுமியங்கள்)\n3. Values - c. Humanism (மனிதநேயம்)\n4. Simile - d. Simile (உவமையணி)", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "1-a, 2-b, 3-c, 4-d", "B": "1-b, 2-a, 3-d, 4-c", "C": "1-c, 2-a, 3-b, 4-d (1-இ, 2-அ, 3-ஆ, 4-ஈ)", "D": "1-d, 2-c, 3-a, 4-b"}, "explanation": "Correct matching: Humanism = மனிதநேயம், Personality = ஆளுமை, Values = விழுமியங்கள், Simile = உவமையணி."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "b