{"id": "9th-u9-q152", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "factual", "level": "comprehension", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u9", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u9-l7", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "thirukkural-theeyavai-theeya-payathalaan", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "\"தீயவை தீய பயத்தலான் தீயவை / தீயினும் அஞ்சப் படும்\" - இக்குறட்பா இடம்பெற்றுள்ள அதிகாரம் எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "அழுக்காறாமை", "B": "வெகுளாமை", "C": "இன்னா செய்யாமை", "D": "தீவினையச்சம் (அதிகாரம் 21)"}, "explanation": "தீய செயல்கள் தீய விளைவுகளையே தரும்; எனவே அத்தீய செயல்களைத் தீயை விடக் கொடியதாகக் கருதி அஞ்ச வேண்டும் என்று வள்ளுவர் 'தீவினையச்சம்' என்னும் அதிகாரத்தில் அறிவுறுத்துகிறார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "In which chapter (Athigaram) does the Kural 'Theeyavai theeya payathalaan theeyavai / theeyinum anjap padum' appear?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Azhukkaaraamai", "B": "Vegulaamai", "C": "Innaa Seyyaamai", "D": "Theevinaiyacham (தீவினையச்சம் - Dread of Evil Deeds, Chapter 21)"}, "explanation": "This verse appears under chapter 21, 'Theevinaiyacham'."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 195, "chapt