{"id": "9th-u9-q155", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "application", "level": "application", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u9", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u9-l7", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "thirukkural-inmaiyin-innaathathu", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "\"இன்மையின் இன்னாதது யாதெனின் இன்மையின் / இன்மையே இன்னா தது\" - இக்குறட்பாவில் பயின்றுவந்துள்ள அணி எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "வேற்றுமை அணி", "B": "உவமை அணி", "C": "சொற்பொருள் பின்வருநிலையணி ('இன்மை', 'இன்னாதது' ஆகிய சொற்கள் ஒரே பொருளில் திரும்பத் திரும்ப வந்துள்ளன)", "D": "வஞ்சப்புகழ்ச்சி அணி"}, "explanation": "'இன்மை' (வறுமை) மற்றும் 'இன்னாதது' (துன்பமானது) என்னும் சொற்கள் குறளில் பலமுறை வந்து அதே பொருளைத் தருவதால் இது 'சொற்பொருள் பின்வருநிலையணி' ஆகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "In the Kural: 'Inmaiyin innaathathu yaathenin inmaiyin / inmaiyae innaa thathu', which figure of speech is featured?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Vaetrumai Ani", "B": "Uvamai Ani", "C": "Sorporul Pinvarunilai Ani ('Inmai' [poverty] and 'Innaathathu' [sorrowful] recur retaining identical meanings)", "D": "Vanjappugazhchi Ani"}, "explanation": "Repetition of 'Inmai' and 'Innaathathu' with identical meanings constitutes Sorporul Pinvarunilai Ani."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 196, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 196", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["9th_tamil", "iyal_9", "thirukkural", "sorporul_kural"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u9-q156", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "factual", "level": "comprehension", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u9", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u9-l7", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "thirukkural-aalvinaiyum-kudi", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "\"ஆள்வினையும் ஆன்ற அறிவும் எனஇரண்டின் / நீள்வினையால் நீளும் குடி\" - இக்குறள் ஒரு குடும்பமும் குடிப்பெருமையும் உயர்வதற்கு எவ்விரண்டு பண்புகள் தேவை எனக் கூறுகிறது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "அழகும் இளமையும்", "B": "அதிகாரமும் படையும்", "C": "நிலமும் மாளிகையும்", "D": "விடாமுயற்சியும் (ஆள்வினை), நிறைந்த அறிவாற்றலும் (ஆன்ற அறிவு)"}, "explanation": "'ஆள்வினை' என்றால் விடாமுயற்சி; 'ஆன்ற அறிவு' என்றால் முதிர்ந்த பேரறிவு. இவ்விரண்டையும் இடைவிடாமல் தொடர்ந்து செய்யும் முயற்சியால்தான் ஒருவனின் குடிப்பெருமை மேலோங்கும் என்று வள்ளுவர் 'குடிசெயல்வகை' அதிகாரத்தில் கூறுகிறார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "In the Kural 'Aalvinaiyum aandra arivum...', what two cardinal qualities elevate and exalt a family line (Kudi)?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Physical beauty and youth", "B": "Authoritarian power and military legions", "C": "Vast landholdings and mansions", "D": "Unyielding perseverance (Aalvinai) and profound wisdom (Aandra Arivu)"}, "explanation": "Persevering effort (Aalvinai) paired with comprehensive wisdom (Aandra Arivu) elevates one's family line."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 195, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 195", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["9th_tamil", "iyal_9", "thirukkural", "kudiseyalvagai"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u9-q157", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "factual", "level": "knowledge", "difficulty": "easy", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u9", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u9-l1", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "pyq-iatr-founding-thaninayagam", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "[TNPSC PYQ] சர்வதேச அளவில் 'உலகத் தமிழாராய்ச்சி மன்றம்' (IATR) என்னும் அமைப்பை உருவாக்கியவர் யார்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "தனிநாயக அடிகள் (Father Xavier Thaninayagam)", "B": "உ. வே. சாமிநாதையர்", "C": "மறைமலையடிகள்", "D": "பரிதிமாற்கலைஞர்"}, "explanation": "1964-இல் புதுதில்லியில் நடைபெற்ற கீழ்த்திசைப் புலவர் மாநாட்டில் உலகத் தமிழாராய்ச்சி மன்றத்தைத் தோற்றுவித்தவர் தனிநாயகம் அடிகளார் ஆவார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "[TNPSC PYQ] Who founded the International Association of Tamil Research (IATR)?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Father Xavier Thaninayagam (தனிநாயக அடிகள்)", "B": "U. V. Swaminatha Iyer", "C": "Maraimalai Adigal", "D": "Parithimaarkalaignar"}, "explanation": "Father Thaninayagam founded the IATR in 1964."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 176, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 1