{"id": "9th-u9-q160", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "factual", "level": "knowledge", "difficulty": "easy", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u9", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u9-l3", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "pyq-nalla-kurunthogai", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "[TNPSC PYQ] எட்டுத்தொகை நூல்களுள் 'நல்ல' என்ற அடைமொழியால் போற்றப்படும் அகப்பொருள் நூல் எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "நற்றிணை", "B": "ஐங்குறுநூறு", "C": "அகநானூறு", "D": "குறுந்தொகை (\"நல்ல குறுந்தொகை\")"}, "explanation": "\"நற்றிணை நல்ல குறுந்தொகை ஐங்குறுநூறு...\" என்ற வெண்பா பாடல் வரிகளில் குறுந்தொகைக்கு 'நல்ல' என்னும் அடைமொழி வழங்கப்பட்டுள்ளது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "[TNPSC PYQ] Which of the Eight Classical Anthologies is traditionally hailed with the honorific prefix 'Nalla' (Noble / Good)?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Natrinai", "B": "Ainkurunuru", "C": "Akananuru", "D": "Kurunthogai ('Nalla Kurunthogai' - நல்ல குறுந்தொகை)"}, "explanation": "Kurunthogai is celebrated as 'Nalla Kurunthogai'."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 181, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 181", "url": null, "source_