{"id": "9th-u9-q163", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "factual", "level": "knowledge", "difficulty": "easy", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u9", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u9-l5", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "pyq-thevar-anaiyar-vanjappugazhchi", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "[TNPSC PYQ] \"தேவர் அனையர் கயவர் அவருந்தாம் / மேவன செய்தொழுக லான்\" - இக்குறட்பாவில் இடம்பெற்றுள்ள அணி யாது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "வேற்றுமை அணி", "B": "உவமை அணி", "C": "வஞ்சப்புகழ்ச்சி அணி", "D": "சொல் பின்வருநிலையணி"}, "explanation": "கயவர்களைத் தேவர்கள் போலத் தாம் விரும்பியவற்றைச் செய்து திரிவர் என்று புகழ்வது போலப் பழித்துக் கூறியதால் இது 'வஞ்சப்புகழ்ச்சி அணி' ஆகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "[TNPSC PYQ] What figure of speech is embedded in: 'Thevar anaiyar kayavar avarundhaam maevana seythozhuga laan'?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Vaetrumai Ani", "B": "Uvamai Ani", "C": "Vanjappugazhchi Ani (வஞ்சப்புகழ்ச்சி அணி - Irony)", "D": "Sol Pinvarunilai Ani"}, "explanation": "Praising scoundrels as gods outwardly while condemning their licentiousness is Vanjappugazhchi Ani."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 192, "chapter":